# SnapshotSchema's public const strings are multi-line raw literals, so their value takes the
# line endings of the checkout. The published packages are built on Linux and carry LF. A
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf would compile CRLF instead: a different constant value
# than the one shipped, and a PublicAPI.Shipped.txt entry that matches on only one platform.
src/ZeroAlloc.EventSourcing.Sql/SnapshotSchema.cs text eol=lf
